---
// Services.astro — Client outcome framing for international SMB audience
---

<section id="services" class="max-w-screen-xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 border-b-2 border-[#111111] bg-[#F9F9F7]">
  <!-- Section Header -->
  <div class="mb-12 border-b-2 border-[#111111] pb-4">
    <div class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-600 font-bold mb-2">
      <span class="lang-en">Services // How We Help Your Business Grow</span>
      <span class="lang-id">Layanan // Bagaimana Kami Membantu Bisnis Anda Tumbuh</span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black uppercase text-[#111111] tracking-tight">
      <span class="lang-en">WHAT WE DO</span>
      <span class="lang-id">APA YANG KAMI LAKUKAN</span>
    </h2>
  </div>

  <!-- Column Grid: 3-cols with Collapsed Borders -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 border border-[#111111] bg-white">
    <!-- Service 1: Websites -->
    <div class="p-8 border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-r border-[#111111] flex flex-col justify-between hover:bg-neutral-100 transition-colors duration-200 group">
      <div>
        <div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-[#CC0000] font-black uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">
          <span class="lang-en">01 / Web Development</span>
          <span class="lang-id">01 / Pengembangan Web</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold uppercase text-[#111111] mb-4 leading-tight">
          <span class="lang-en">WEBSITES THAT RANK & CONVERT</span>
          <span class="lang-id">SITUS WEB YANG BERKUALITAS & MENGHASILKAN KONVERSI</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="font-body text-sm text-neutral-600 text-justify mb-4">
          <span class="lang-en">Custom-built websites engineered for Google page 1. No templates, no page builders — just precision-crafted code that loads in under one second. Every site ships with perfect Lighthouse scores, mobile-first design, and SEO baked in from day one.</span>
          <span class="lang-id">Situs web buatan kustom yang dirancang untuk halaman 1 Google. Tanpa template, tanpa pembuat halaman instan — hanya kode yang dibuat secara presisi yang dimuat dalam waktu kurang dari satu detik. Setiap situs dilengkapi dengan skor Lighthouse sempurna, desain mobile-first, dan SEO terintegrasi sejak hari pertama.</span>
        </p>
        <p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-500 mb-6">
          <span class="lang-en">Ideal for: Local businesses, e-commerce, service companies, startups</span>
          <span class="lang-id">Ideal untuk: Bisnis lokal, e-commerce, perusahaan jasa, startup</span>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="border-t border-[#111111] pt-4 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-600">
          <span class="font-bold text-neutral-900 block mb-1">
            <span class="lang-en">BUILT WITH</span>
            <span class="lang-id">DIBANGUN DENGAN</span>
          </span>
          React, Astro, Next.js, Laravel, Tailwind, TypeScript
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Service 2: AI -->
    <div class="p-8 border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-r border-[#111111] flex flex-col justify-between hover:bg-neutral-100 transition-colors duration-200 group">
      <div>
        <div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-[#CC0000] font-black uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">
          <span class="lang-en">02 / AI Automation</span>
          <span class="lang-id">02 / Otomatisasi AI</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold uppercase text-[#111111] mb-4 leading-tight">
          <span class="lang-en">AI CHATBOTS THAT WORK FOR YOU</span>
          <span class="lang-id">AI CHATBOT YANG BEKERJA UNTUK ANDA</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="font-body text-sm text-neutral-600 text-justify mb-4">
          <span class="lang-en">Intelligent customer service agents that handle bookings, answer questions, and reduce your support costs by up to 35%. Deployed on your website, WhatsApp, or Telegram — they work 24/7 so your team doesn't have to.</span>
          <span class="lang-id">Agen layanan pelanggan cerdas yang menangani pemesanan, menjawab pertanyaan, dan mengurangi biaya dukungan Anda hingga 35%. Diterapkan di situs web Anda, WhatsApp, atau Telegram — mereka bekerja 24/7 sehingga tim Anda tidak perlu melakukannya.</span>
        </p>
        <p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-500 mb-6">
          <span class="lang-en">Ideal for: Hotels, restaurants, clinics, e-commerce stores</span>
          <span class="lang-id">Ideal untuk: Hotel, restoran, klinik, toko e-commerce</span>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="border-t border-[#111111] pt-4 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-600">
          <span class="font-bold text-neutral-900 block mb-1">
            <span class="lang-en">BUILT WITH</span>
            <span class="lang-id">DIBANGUN DENGAN</span>
          </span>
          Python, LLM APIs, RAG, Vector DBs, Telegram & WhatsApp APIs
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Service 3: Custom Tools -->
    <div class="p-8 flex flex-col justify-between hover:bg-neutral-100 transition-colors duration-200 group">
      <div>
        <div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-[#CC0000] font-black uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">
          <span class="lang-en">03 / Custom Tools</span>
          <span class="lang-id">03 / Alat Kustom</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold uppercase text-[#111111] mb-4 leading-tight">
          <span class="lang-en">CUSTOM TOOLS & DASHBOARDS</span>
          <span class="lang-id">ALAT & DASHBOARD KUSTOM</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="font-body text-sm text-neutral-600 text-justify mb-4">
          <span class="lang-en">Internal tools, reporting dashboards, and monitoring systems built exactly to your specifications. Stop paying for expensive SaaS products you barely use — get a tool that does exactly what you need, nothing more.</span>
          <span class="lang-id">Alat internal, dashboard pelaporan, dan sistem pemantauan yang dibangun persis sesuai spesifikasi Anda. Berhentilah membayar produk SaaS mahal yang jarang Anda gunakan — dapatkan alat yang melakukan tepat apa yang Anda butuhkan, tidak lebih.</span>
        </p>
        <p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-500 mb-6">
          <span class="lang-en">Ideal for: Operations teams, traders, healthcare, education</span>
          <span class="lang-id">Ideal untuk: Tim operasional, trader, layanan kesehatan, pendidikan</span>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="border-t border-[#111111] pt-4 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-600">
          <span class="font-bold text-neutral-900 block mb-1">
            <span class="lang-en">BUILT WITH</span>
            <span class="lang-id">DIBANGUN DENGAN</span>
          </span>
          Python, Node.js, PostgreSQL, Charting Libraries, Desktop APIs
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Ornamental Divider -->
  <div class="py-8 text-center font-serif text-2xl text-neutral-400 tracking-[1em] select-none">
    ✦ ✦ ✦
  </div>
</section>
